OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Glastonbury 2027 tickets
OL,4,Asell out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first batch of tickets for
OL,7,FGlastonbury Festival have sold out in
OL,8,Fless than 30 minutes, according to the
OL,9,Forganisers.
OL,11,FThe event will take place from 23-27
OL,12,FJune 2027 at Worthy Farm in Pilton,
OL,13,FSomerset, after a fallow year in 2026.
OL,15,FCoach tickets have now sold out after
OL,16,Fless than half an hour, after going on
OL,17,Fsale at 18:00 BST on Thursday. General
OL,18,Fadmission tickets go on sale at 09:00
OL,19,FBST on Sunday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
