OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Glastonbury 2027 tickets
OL,4,Asell out
OL,5,
OL,6,FJessi Dimmock from Glasto Cast, a
OL,7,Fpodcast covering the festival, said:
OL,8,F"It's the most stressful weekend of my
OL,9,Fyear. I'll be there Sunday morning with
OL,10,Fmy phone, my laptop, and my coffee and
OL,11,FI will be stressed."
